contentText:
The United States Department of Homeland Security (DHS) is hitting back at Billie Eilish after the singer reshared a series of posts on her Instagram Story calling ICE a &#8220;terrorist group&#8221; in light of the fatal shooting of a woman in Minneapolis earlier this week.

